      <p class="_abstract">In some cases, more than one cluster CR can match a template because they feature the same <code>apiVersion</code>, <code>namespace</code>, and <code>kind</code>. The plugin’s default matching compares the CR that features the least differences.</p>
      <p>You can optionally configure your reference configuration to avoid this situation.</p>
      <p><strong>Procedure</strong></p>
      <ol>
      <li>Ensure the templates feature distinct <code>apiVersion</code>, <code>namespace</code>, and <code>kind</code> values to ensure no duplicate template matching.</li>
